  "description": "Jung Se-In believed she found true love in Seo I-Han despite only knowing him for four months. Unfortunately, he leaves on an extended business trip right after their wedding. Having only met with him once in their six years of marriage, Se-In can't help but feel hopeless about their future together. But suddenly, I-Han shows up at her workplace as executive director! Not only that, he’s even trying his best to seduce her! Six years after their wedding, will Se-In finally enjoy her honeymoon?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
